      (dsR6_50 (lvR6_50 inputs)) 659060556 (interpDag (raw.toDag (cnstw F)) inputs 26928)
      hma hmb hmc hmd hme hmp
      (by norm_num [gR6_50a]) (by norm_num [gR6_50b]) (by norm_num [gR6_50c]) (by norm_num [gR6_50d]) (by norm_num [gR6_50e]) (by norm_num [dsR6_50])
